<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-NatWest cuts Zeneca, SmithKline.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-NatWest cuts Zeneca, SmithKline.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatWest Markets said on Tuesday it had reduced its earnings estimates for UK drug companies Zeneca Plc and SmithKline Beecham Plc because of the strength of sterling.  </p>
<p>Dealers said the brokerage reduced its 1997 and 1998 earnings estimates for both companies by three to four percent, purely on currency factors.</p>
<p>NatWest cut its profit forecasts for Glaxo Wellcome Plc about ten days ago, they said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
